# Guitar Tool Project Context & Task Tracker

## Current Goals (All Complete)

- [x] **Android-Only Audio Pipeline:** Configured `useAudioStream` with `encoding: 'int16'` (`AudioFormat.ENCODING_PCM_16BIT`), resolving device HAL compatibility issues where `float32` recording was unsupported and crashed stream initialization. Decodes 16-bit PCM integer samples to normalized `Float32Array` [-1.0, 1.0].
- [x] **Auto-Start Audio Listening:** Wired `TunerScreen` mount/unmount lifecycle with `startListening()` and `stopListening()`, ensuring audio capture activates immediately when the screen is viewed without needing manual button prompts.
- [x] **Pure YIN Autocorrelation:** Removed time-domain Hanning window that caused envelope discrepancies in $x[i] - x[i+\tau]$ and artificially elevated CMNDF. Implemented constant integration window $W = N - \tau_{max}$ and parabolic sub-sample interpolation for sub-cent precision across all guitar strings.
- [x] **Professional Pitch & Cents UI:** Arc-style needle gauge with ±8¢ in-tune highlight zone, digital cents display, Hz deviation readout, string lock-on badges, directional arrows (Tune Up / Tune Down), and semantic color coding (green/yellow/red).
- [x] **Zero Emojis — All Vector Icons:** Removed all emojis and raw unicode symbols (`🔒`, `⚡`, `✓`, `↑`, `↓`, `♭`, `♯`, `›`). Replaced with `Feather` vector icons (`lock`, `zap`, `check-circle`, `arrow-up`, `arrow-down`, `trending-down`, `trending-up`, `chevron-right`).
- [x] **iOS Directory & Configurations Removed:** Removed `apps/mobile/ios/`, removed iOS configuration blocks from `apps/mobile/app.json`, removed `ios` scripts, and purged iOS-specific audio session branches.
- [x] **100% Test Coverage:** Vitest test suite in `packages/tuner-core` (12 tests) and `packages/music-core` (7 tests) passing with realistic harmonic series, microtonal offsets, and noise models. 0 TypeScript compiler errors.

## Architecture Notes

- **Platform Target:** Android-first / Android-only (with Web Audio API fallback for web testing)
- **Monorepo:** `apps/mobile` + `packages/tuner-core` + `packages/music-core`
- **State Management:** Zustand (`useTunerStore`) with AsyncStorage persistence for preferences (referenceA4, capoFret, activeTuning)
- **Native Audio Capture:** `expo-audio` (`AudioStream`) in `int16` PCM mode
  - Sample Rate: Hardware reported (typically 48000 Hz or 44100 Hz)
  - Channels: 1 (Mono)
  - Buffer Size: 4096 samples (~85.3ms history) in `RingBuffer`
  - Integration Window: $W = N - \tau_{max} = 3136$ samples
  - Noise Gate: RMS threshold 0.003
  - Silence Detection: 3 consecutive frames before clearing note display
- **Pitch Detection:** `YinDetector`
  - Range: 50 Hz to 1100 Hz
  - Primary Threshold: 0.15 with local minimum tracking
  - Relaxed Fallback: +0.15 for weak plucks / fingerstyle
  - Sub-sample Precision: Parabolic interpolation on CMNDF minimum
- **Post-Filter:** `StabilityFilter`
  - History: 3 frames (median filter for attack transient rejection)
  - Smoothing: EMA with $\alpha = 0.7$
  - Jump Detection: >80¢ jump resets filter for instant string plucking transitions
- **Iconography:** `@expo/vector-icons` (`Feather`) across all screens and components — zero unicode emojis.
- **Theme:** Pure claymorphism design system (`clay.ts`) — solid surfaces, layered ambient/specular elevation shadows, zero blur.

